{"name":"Total Recall","hex":"#f6ead8","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"total recall","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The ability to remember in great detail; possessing photographic memory."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/total_recall"}],"entries":[{"title":"Eidetic memory","blocks":[{"text":"Eidetic memory, also known as photographic memory or total recall, is the alleged ability to recall an image from memory with high precision—at least for a brief period of time—after seeing it only once and without using a mnemonic device."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eidetic_memory"},{"title":"Hyperthymesia","blocks":[{"text":"Hyperthymesia, also known as hyperthymestic syndrome or highly superior autobiographical memory (HSAM), is a condition that leads people to be able to remember an abnormally large number of their life experiences in vivid detail. It is extraordinarily rare, with fewer than 100 people in the world having been diagnosed with the condition as of 2021. A person who has hyperthymesia is called a hyperthymesiac."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hyperthymesia"},{"title":"Total Recall (1990 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Total Recall is a 1990 American science fiction action film directed by Paul Verhoeven, with a screenplay by Ronald Shusett, Dan O'Bannon, and Gary Goldman. The film stars Arnold Schwarzenegger, Rachel Ticotin, Sharon Stone, Ronny Cox, and Michael Ironside. Based on the 1966 short story \"We Can Remember It for You Wholesale\" by Philip K. Dick, Total Recall tells the story of Douglas Quaid (Schwarzenegger), a construction worker who receives an implanted memory of a fantastical adventure on Mars. He subsequently finds his adventure occurring in reality as agents of a shadow organization try to prevent him from recovering memories of his past as a Martian secret agent aiming to stop the tyrannical regime of the planet's dictator Vilos Cohaagen (Cox)."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/2/2d/Total_Recall_%281990_film%29_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Total_Recall_(1990_film)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/A._Schwarzenegger_%283x4a%29.jpg/500px-A._Schwarzenegger_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/A._Schwarzenegger_%283x4a%29.jpg/1280px-A._Schwarzenegger_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/A._Schwarzenegger_%283x4a%29.jpg/500px-A._Schwarzenegger_%283x4a%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AA._Schwarzenegger_(3x4a).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Sharon_Stone_2005_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Sharon_Stone_2005_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Sharon_Stone_2005_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Sharon_Stone_2005_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASharon_Stone_2005_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Ronny_Cox_2019.jpg/500px-Ronny_Cox_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Ronny_Cox_2019.jpg/1280px-Ronny_Cox_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Ronny_Cox_2019.jpg/500px-Ronny_Cox_2019.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail",